iconsmith:test:   6. Finalize the exact inspected artifacts for independent review. Compiler correction and named visual repair have separate bounded allowances under the original deadline. Missing paperwork requests finalization only; uncertain evidence requests clarification only. A clean render alone is not acceptance.
