iconsmith:test: 
iconsmith:test:   `iconsmith new` is the product path: cheap host experts (compile / mark / analog) first, the gateway or OpenRouter agent only if they fail. Third-party packs (Lucide, Heroicons, Tabler, Remix) contribute _names_ for inventory, never drawings. `iconsmith improve --control analog --treatment agent --class pack-inventory --concepts …` is the A/B that updates that routing table. Do not paste Lucide path data into a program.
iconsmith:test: 
iconsmith:test:   `draw` writes SVG on stdout and diagnostics on stderr, so the redirect above always produces a valid file. Both commands exit non-zero on an error and 0 on warnings alone. Every command takes `--output json`; the default text output is for humans.
